# Staged by fisher-8hc.4 on 2026-11-26.
# UCI setoption (April 2006): https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/#gui-setoption.
# Searched info spelling: fisher-r6y D41 and Stockfish sf_19 (edb0d9d),
# UCIEngine::on_update_full and SearchManager::output_pv, read 2026-11-24.
# D12, D13 and fisher-8hc answers 5 and 6 (2026-11-24) set the requested
# counts, numbering and bestmove. Ties leave the moves open (D5, D48 and
# the 2026-11-27 comment on fisher-8hc).
# Enumeration: python-chess 1.11.2 (https://pypi.org/project/chess/1.11.2/).
# Published depth-1 perft in expectations/perft.epd and python-chess
# give 20 root moves from startpos. None captures or promotes, so every
# depth-1 score is cp 0 by material (fisher-2aj rules 2 and 3).

> position startpos
> go depth 1
< info depth 1 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 20 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< bestmove {legal}

# D12 and fisher-8hc's Implementation Decisions match the name in any case.
> setoption name mUlTiPv value 3
> go depth 1
< info depth 1 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes {nodes} nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 1 multipv 2 score cp 0 nodes {nodes} nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 1 multipv 3 score cp 0 nodes {nodes} nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< bestmove {legal}

> setoption name MultiPV value 1
> go depth 1
< info depth 1 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 20 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< bestmove {legal}
> quit
! exit
